e SQL  database and of course since we designed  spanner at Google to scale with our  business we made sure it can handle very  large databases let's switch over to our  monitoring tools Tech driver the graphs  show the history of our demo database  and there are a couple of things to  point out here first in the upper right  you'll see that when we setup the  database we were able to load data at  over 800 megabytes per second  sustainable that even peaked at around  one gigabyte per second that's just  crazy fast right second you can see on  the lower left we run the whole demo  against the database that is over 80  terabyte  illogical data let's recap you can  create a highly reliable performant  fully managed multi-regional database in  seconds cloud spanner is a relational  database with the power of SQL and asset  transactions plus advanced features like  versioning strong consistency and online  schema changes you can scale out and in  as needed fully managed and you don't  have to worry about replication your  system even automatically Tunes itself  for performance and last but not least  cloud spanner is built for scale Google  has been running largest operational  data set on it globally for years check  out cloud spanner today and find more  information like best practices and case  studies of spanner on cloud.google.com  slash spanner  [Music]

